<figure data-component="quote-with-author" class="relative h-full rounded-[50px] lg:rounded-[60px] rounded-br-md lg:rounded-br-md flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden ll-green ll-red-gradient">
	<blockquote class="relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-2 p-8 py-10 text-lg xl:text-[1.625rem] grow font-heading text-zoom-xl:p-[15px]">
		<div class="w-full text-blue-900 break-words md:text-zoom-xl:pr-[200px]">
			<span >&ldquo;</span>Toen ik <b class="ll-word-highlight">zwanger</b> was, kreeg ik geen contractverlenging. Discriminatie.nl heeft mij goed geïnformeerd over mijn rechten zodat ik de situatie zelf kon oplossen.<span >&rdquo;</span>
		</div>
	</blockquote>

			<div class="relative w-full flex items-end justify-end gap-4 pr-0 image:max-h-[400px] image:translate-x-[20%] image:w-auto image:mt-[-25%] text-zoom-lg:mt-0">
