									<h2 class="mb-4 text-xl break-words font-heading text-blue md:text-2xl">Wil je liever op locatie in jouw eigen regio geholpen worden? Dat kan!</h2>
				
				<div class="flex items-center justify-center svg:h-auto svg:w-[200px] svg:lg:w-full">
					<svg width="518" height="611" viewBox="0 0 518 611" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
